request.description:
Ejemplo del model card de strands-decider. `noul` devuelve la probabilidad de que la afirmación sea cierta.

### Contenido del mensaje `user` (legible)
En el body va serializado como string dentro de `messages[0].content`.

```json
{
  "state": "Help! My payouts have been failing for 3 days!",
  "questions": {
    "is_urgent": {
      "type": "noul",
      "instructions": "Does this convey urgency?"
    }
  }
}
```

body.raw:
{
  "model": "strands-decider",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "{\"state\": \"Help! My payouts have been failing for 3 days!\", \"questions\": {\"is_urgent\": {\"type\": \"noul\", \"instructions\": \"Does this convey urgency?\"}}}"
    }
  ]
}

